// Regla Sigma: proc_creation_win_dotnetdump_memory_dump.yml
// ID Sigma: 53d8d3e1-ca33-4012-adf3-e05a4d652e34
// Título: Process Memory Dump Via Dotnet-Dump
// Descripción: Detects the execution of "dotnet-dump" with the "collect" flag. The execution could indicate potential process dumping of critical processes such as LSASS.

// Aplica a: Producto: windows | Categoría: process_creation
// Producto: windows
// Categoría: process_creation
// Servicio: 
// Nivel: medium
// Pipeline: microsoft_xdr
// Ruta original: C:\SigmaLab\sigma\rules\windows\process_creation\proc_creation_win_dotnetdump_memory_dump.yml
// Requiere validación en el entorno de destino.

DeviceProcessEvents
| where (FolderPath endswith "\\dotnet-dump.exe" or ProcessVersionInfoOriginalFileName =~ "dotnet-dump.dll") and ProcessCommandLine contains "collect"
